<title>GERMANY: Bundesbank data show rise in net reserves in week.</title>
<headline>Bundesbank data show rise in net reserves in week.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-05-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bundesbank data released on Tuesday show that net currency reserves rose to about 102.7 billion marks in the week ending May 7, from about 102.2 billion in the week ending April 30.</p>
<p>The Bundesbank provided the following reserve data: (in billion marks)</p>
<p> Banking week ended		    May 7	   April 30</p>
<p> Gross currency reserves	     118.2	   117.7</p>
<p> Foreign liabilities		   15.5	    15.5</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
